    "disposition": "S14 should reconcile original text/declaration composition and the shared captured-font input ABI, coordinated with S13 drawing context ownership. Moving the entire mixed precomp to B retains outward dependencies. Adding a file-specific duplicate context or removing restored helpers is not an in-place solution. C0066/C0392 stay open; no new exception.",
